<LANGUAGE>
    <CATEGORY Name="Voices_02_02_ms_curie_inside">
        <Entry Name="radio_1_staticvoice_001_automatedvoice_001">Warning! Catastrophic impact event has turned the surface lethally toxic to humans. CURIE is to remain submerged.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_001_catherine_001">Huh, what?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_002_catherine_001">You made it. This is much better. Let&apos;s see if we can&apos;t get this thing moving.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_003_catherine_001">What... safety locks are blocking the vessel&apos;s release? How much more of an emergency could this ship be in? It&apos;s on the bottom of the sea!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_004_catherine_001">Take a look at the engine room and see if you can figure it out. Maybe there&apos;s an override or something.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_005_player_001">There&apos;s monsters out there. Like the one we saw at Lambda.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_006_catherine_001">The more reason to get going.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_007_player_001">What?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_008_catherine_001">Come on, you know the drill: Don&apos;t look at them or get too close. It will mess with your circuits.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_009_player_001">Ah, shit.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_010_catherine_001">We need to get out of here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2a_plugincatherine_011_player_001">I know, I know. I&apos;m going.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_1_001_player_001">What are those things? They look like people. Really messed-up people.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_1_002_catherine_001">I think they could be dead people brought back.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_1_003_player_001">To life.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_1_004_catherine_001">Sure, let&apos;s call it that.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_2_001_player_001">Do you think we should try going to the surface?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_2_002_catherine_001">No, the comet really did a number on the atmosphere. I doubt it will ever be &quot;okay&quot; again.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_2_003_player_001">I was afraid you&apos;d say that.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_3_001_player_001">You think this thing will get us to Theta in one piece?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_3_002_catherine_001">I don&apos;t see why not. It looks perfectly fine.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_3_003_player_001">Really, fine? I probably wouldn&apos;t use that word, but I&apos;m glad you&apos;re confident.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="radio_captaindialog_1_001_captain_001">Attention crew, this is your captain speaking. The final efforts to stop the comet have officially failed. Impact is imminent. See you on the other side.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3a_removewau_001_catherine_001">Christ, what did you do?! The reactor just lost all balance, I think we&apos;re in deep...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3a_removewau_002_catherine_001">Simon, the lifeboat locks just released -- quick, get back here!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_001_player_001">Ok, I&apos;m in.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_002_catherine_001">Then let&apos;s get the hell out of here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_003_player_001">What&apos;s taking so long?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_004_catherine_001">I need to pump all the water out before we take off.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_005_player_001">Can&apos;t you do it any faster?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_006_catherine_001">Almost there.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_waterdrained_001_catherine_001">All right, here we go. Hold on to something!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_branch2_001_catherine_001">What the hell happened here? What are all these emergency -- What did you do?!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_branch2_002_player_001">I messed up, okay? Can you get us out of here?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_branch2_003_catherine_001">Yes, yes. I just need to pump out the water and get a trajectory in place.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_branch2_004_player_001">Hurry up.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_lifeboatescape_branch2_005_catherine_001">Just a second.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_3c_waterdrained_branch2_001_catherine_001">All right, taking off. Hold on to something!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="radio_captaindialog_2_001_captain_001">CURIE is safe while submerged. The crew -what&apos;s left of it - is doing okay. For the rest of the world, there&apos;s no good way to describe it. The destruction is absolute. The surface is just gone.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="radio_brockleydialog_1_001_brockley_001">We&apos;re fucked. This was a huge mistake. Even with the suits -- we&apos;re just in a mess up here. Keep CURIE safe. Forget about Omega, forget about the surface.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_hintescapepod_lookforpowerroom_1_001_catherine_001">Something is stabilizing the ship. We need to let it know this is an emergency.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_hintescapepod_lookforpowerroom_2_001_catherine_001">Convince the ship that this is an emergency.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_hintescapepod_wreckpowerroom_1_001_catherine_001">Sabotage the stabilizer, Simon. The black cords you mentioned, pull them down.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_hintescapepod_wreckpowerroom_2_001_catherine_001">Tear down all the black cords.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_proom_001_player_001">Do you know anything about dark metallic cords that seem to be feeding off the machinery?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_proom_002_catherine_001">Huh?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_proom_002_catherine_002"> Oh. You mean the WAU is here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_proom_003_player_001">What?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_proom_004_catherine_001">That&apos;s what&apos;s keeping the ship together.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2b_returntolifeboat_proom_004_catherine_002">Pull them, Simon. Pull them all down.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2c_flesherenterslifeboat_001_catherine_001">Look out!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2c_enterlifeboatafterdeath_001_catherine_001">Simon? Are you okay?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2c_enterlifeboatafterdeath_002_player_001">I think so.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="cathmeeting_2c_enterlifeboatafterdeath_003_catherine_001">You really scared me. Thought I was going to be trapped here forever.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="simoncomments_1_enterlevel_001_player_001">All right, we&apos;re in. Let&apos;s find a working Escape Vessel.</Entry>
    </CATEGORY>
</LANGUAGE>
